# TEST ONLY: the common packages of a DEV build (UC_PXX_DEV_OVERLAY=1). This
# list holds the common packages that the profile meta packages uc-pxx-console,
# -kiosk and -ha of tsx-aports pull. Keep it equal to their depends. It is the
# same set as the meta packages of the xx60 (tsx-xx60-console, -kiosk, -ha)
# without the LED bar.
# Format: PROFILE PACKAGE. A profile gets the lines of every profile that it
# holds (profile.sh includes).
console tsx-base
console tsx-autoupdate
console tsx-buttons
console tsx-idled
console tsx-splash
kiosk tsx-kiosk
kiosk tsx-setup
ha tsx-ha
ha tsx-panel-app
